      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然，在比赛中也必须取得与“女帝”之名相符的成绩。\r\n但不仅仅是胜利，成为众人憧憬的目标，才是我的使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "377fe41faa3eba37aed48334a4087a4d74027849ad1e79fbaaa8652e57310695",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
